      "updated": 1786968943862,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "n= 40K unique operators\nm= 500k UC packets/day\nt= 6 per packet transaction\nf= 10 features/opt/30sec\nz= 100 unique operators making \npacket per 30 sec\n\nTotal UC transactions:- \n500K*6= 3M/day\n\nTotal Features:-\n2*60*9*100 = 108k/day \n\n\n",
